CH32V305 Pico PCB Changelog
===========================

Version 2                                                2026-09-17
------------------------------------------------------------------

Changed from a four-layer PCB to a two-layer PCB to reduce
manufacturing costs for volume production.

Release files:

    EDA project: v2/ProPrj_ch32v305_pico.epro

    Gerber and drill files: v2/ch32v305_pico_rev2_2026-09-17.zip

Version 1                                                2026-08-29
------------------------------------------------------------------

This is the initial hardware validation revision.

Validated:

    Basic power input and onboard power-supply operation.

    USB High Speed (USBHS) connectivity and communication.

Known limitations:

    Hand-solderability still needs improvement. Component placement
    and pad accessibility will be refined in a future PCB revision.
